  "region_or_platform_notes": "The models API sets expiration_date to 2026-12-31. The models guide calls expiration_date the deprecation date for the model endpoint, and null if the endpoint is not deprecated. The model schema says this is the date after which the model may be removed, not a day the model is guaranteed to stop. This response does not name a replacement. canonical_slug is microsoft/mai-voice-2-flash-20260723. The models API input_modalities is text and output_modalities is speech. The models API sets context_length is 0 and max_completion_tokens is 0. The models API pricing is prompt 0.000015 and completion 0. Output is not text, so those values are not stored as per-million-token prices.",
